{"id":"633698","name":"焦糖布丁","author":"Dinaking","authorId":"12567629","desc":"","cover":"images/633698/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"白砂糖","amount":"60克"},{"name":"清水","amount":"15克"},{"name":"热水","amount":"25克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好所有材料。","img":"images/633698/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"把白砂糖个15克清水加入锅中，开小火融化，期间不用搅拌。","img":"images/633698/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"小火加热至焦糖色后关火加入热水轻微摇换一下。","img":"images/633698/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"把焦糖加入到烤完中备用。","img":"images/633698/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"把鸡蛋打入碗中。","img":"images/633698/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入白砂糖和几滴香草精。","img":"images/633698/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搅拌均匀备用。","img":"images/633698/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"牛奶小火加至微热。","img":"images/633698/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"慢慢倒入鸡蛋液中，边倒边搅拌。","img":"images/633698/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"然后把牛奶鸡蛋液过筛到烤碗中。","img":"images/633698/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"烤箱提前预热到150°，烤盘中加入热水，摆入烤碗。","img":"images/633698/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"设置温度150°烤40分钟。","img":"images/633698/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"烤完出炉。","img":"images/633698/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"超级嫩滑，真的太好吃了。","img":"images/633698/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}